OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fnight with initially patchy rain and
OL,7,Fdrizzle. This becomes more widespread
OL,8,Facross the region with some heavier
OL,9,Fbursts through the early hours. Milder
OL,10,Fthan recent nights.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA damp and cloudy start
OL,13,Facross much of the region with
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain, heavy at times.
OL,15,FFeeling rather chilly despite light
OL,16,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
