OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FWet
OL,6,Fand potentially windy on Wednesday,
OL,7,Fbefore sunny spells and isolated
OL,8,Fshowers develop into Thursday with
OL,9,Flighter winds. Heavy rain will spread
OL,10,Fnortheastwards into Friday with strong
OL,11,Fwinds likely.
